<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$0.50-1.00 higher. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     60.50-61.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     59.50-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     57.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     54.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 1.00 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     47.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     49.50</p>
</text>
